%H A306545 <a href="/index/Rec#order_03">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (8,-19,12).
%F A306545 G.f.: (17*x^4-27*x^3+17*x^2-1)/((4*x-1)*(3*x-1)*(x-1)).
%F A306545 a(n) = A299789(2n+2,n).
%F A306545 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Sep 29 2026: (Start)
%F A306545 a(n) = 25*4^(n-2) + 4*3^(n-2) - 1 for n >= 2.
%F A306545 a(n) = 8*a(n-1) - 19*a(n-2) + 12*a(n-3) for n > 4.
%F A306545 E.g.f.: (1/144)*(-1 + 4*(51*x - 36*exp(x) + 16*exp(3*x)) + 225*exp(4*x)). (End)
%e A306545 a(1) = 8: 2143, 2341, 2413, 3142, 3421, 4123, 4312, 4321.
